{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S11–S13的心理因果改写不如Y清楚，尤其S12弱化了“不确定对方是否同样在乎，却仍想把一切给出去”的情感动机，S13也不如Y明确交代他为什么想重新藏起心意。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然感受信息更多，但小字、重点词加亮和按乐句分时出现，实际上降低了同时需要处理的信息量，观众更容易先抓住故事主线，再在音乐对应的位置接收到细腻感受。它的水波、船身摇荡、失去支撑、重新停稳等意象也形成了贯穿始终的感官线索，让前后变化更像一段完整经历。Y在后半段的心理解释和因果表达更准确直接，但整体听感对应、情绪层次和具体细节不及X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d92bf2f5-dd32-495a-92ac-8ffb3758cc92", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T155128897979Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:52:37.957427+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "02f4f291eae7e81ea68ce0fb111eaffb56721537952853f8e0ae98f1c62f433e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c